        "message": "=Hello {{ $json[\"Full Name\"].split(\" \")[0] }},\n\nThank you for booking with us at Eterna Beauty Salon & Spa. We're so looking forward to seeing you for your {{ $json.Service }} on {{ $json[\"Appointment Date\"] }}.\n\nIn the meantime, if you have any questions or would like to adjust your appointment, please don't hesitate to reach out. We're here to make sure your experience is exactly what you're hoping for.\n\nTake care, and we'll see you soon.\n\nWarm regards,\nThe Eterna Beauty Team",
